{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRUKT</strong> is a death sandbox where every kill becomes an experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill, dismember, and torment highly detailed voxel-based humanoids. Every bone breaks, every muscle tears, every organ reacts to damage. No rules, no story - only death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic dismemberment</strong>: tear off limbs, slice everything into pieces - body is fully physical and voxel-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.poster.avif?t=1759776271\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.webm?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.mp4?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functional organs</strong>: the heart pumps blood, the brain controls the body, muscles hold strength. Hit the heart and the ragdoll will bleed out. Destroy the brain and it dies instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.poster.avif?t=1759776271\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.webm?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/7f34e286a11af5f972706728f4ad7945.mp4?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical balance</strong>: victims react naturally to all impacts, trying to stay on their feet and falling like real humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.poster.avif?t=1759776271\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.webm?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/bdb3f944f9f7728f934b9a7e3ca1b4dd.mp4?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic movement</strong>: every step depends on muscle strength and the surface below. Break the legs and watch them fail to hold the body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.poster.avif?t=1759776271\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.webm?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/2828d28d40557ca79f087cb07a9f90ce.mp4?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to support development?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>FRUKT</strong> to your Steam wishlist and don\u2019t miss the release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want to share ideas and follow updates?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976840?t=1759776271","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976840?t=1759776271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/f9f9c72c602e1909b9d94b94486d74ae53a85f7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759776271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/f9f9c72c602e1909b9d94b94486d74ae53a85f7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759776271","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains a huge amount of stylised but extremely detailed violence."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRUKT</strong> is a death sandbox where every kill becomes an experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill, dismember, and torment highly detailed voxel-based humanoids. Every bone breaks, every muscle tears, every organ reacts to damage. No rules, no story - only death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic dismemberment</strong>: tear off limbs, slice everything into pieces - body is fully physical and voxel-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.poster.avif?t=1759776271\" width=650 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976840/extras/73ab807b49f737eab1c8a1dfffde63cb.webm?t=1759776271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=